codesight
==========

This product bundles code from Understand-Anything
(https://github.com/Egonex-AI/Understand-Anything), used under the MIT License.

The vendored portions are the deterministic structure extractor — the file
scanner, import-map extractor, structure extractor, and the tree-sitter parser
core (language configs, plugins, ignore filter, and content fingerprinting).
The LLM analysis half of Understand-Anything (summaries, tours, layers,
domain graphs) is NOT included.

